@Service
public class SaleService {
    private final SaleRepository saleRepository;
    private final BillOfMaterialItemRepository bomRepository;
    private final InventoryService inventoryService;
    private final UomConverterService uomConverterService;

    @Transactional
    public SaleResponse completeSale(Long saleId) {
        Sale sale = saleRepository.findByIdForUpdate(saleId).orElseThrow(...);
        if (sale.getStatus() == COMPLETED) return map(sale); // idempotent
        if (sale.getStatus() != OPEN) throw new IllegalStateException(...)
        List<IngredientRequirement> requirements = aggregateRequirements(sale);
        inventoryService.deductAll(requirements, sale.getSaleNumber());
        sale.setStatus(COMPLETED);
        sale.setCompletedAt(Instant.now());
        sale.setInventoryDeducted(true);
        return map(saleRepository.save(sale));
    }
}
```

Aggregation: group by rawMaterialId, sum converted quantities. Important because two menu items may share raw material.

```java
private List<IngredientRequirement> aggregateRequirements(Sale sale) {
    Map<Long, IngredientRequirement> map = new LinkedHashMap<>();
    for (SaleItem item : sale.getItems()) {
        List<BillOfMaterialItem> bom = bomRepository.findByMenuItemId(item.getMenuItem().getId());
        if (bom.isEmpty()) { log.warn(...); continue; }
        for (BillOfMaterialItem b : bom) {
            BigDecimal portions = item.getQuantity(); // BigDecimal
            BigDecimal recipeQty = b.getQuantity().multiply(portions, MC);
            // apply waste
            if (b.getWastePercent() != null && > 0) recipeQty = recipeQty.multiply(ONE + waste/100)
            BigDecimal baseQty = uomConverterService.convert(recipeQty, b.getUom(), b.getRawMaterial().getBaseUom());
            map.computeIfAbsent(...).add(baseQty)
        }
    }
    return new ArrayList<>(map.values());
}
```

